{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":57795,"duration_api_ms":57153,"num_turns":14,"result":"I rewrote the existing `CLAUDE.md` rather than creating a new one. I didn't build or run any examples. The new content comes from reading the Makefiles, CI workflows, `.gitmodules` and scripts.\n\n**Fixes:**\n- **Build styles:** the old file said most examples use `make`. About half (0–10, 19–22, 25, 31, 32, 36, 37, 39, 40) have no Makefile and are built with `ecc` and run with `ecli`.\n- **Master Makefile:** it is at `src/`, not the repo root. The example dirs are `src/<N>-<name>`.\n- **Submodules:** `bpftool` and `blazesym` are submodules and are empty on a fresh clone. `libbpf` is a symlink to `bpftool/libbpf`. Builds fail until `git submodule update --init --recursive` is run.\n- **Architectures:** the old list included mips, which has no vmlinux header, so I removed it.\n\n**Additions:**\n- **Testing:** there is no test suite or linter. CI builds each example and runs it for 3 seconds under `timeout`, and treats exit 124 as success.\n- **Build details:** how each libbpf Makefile builds an example (clang to `.bpf.o`, then a bpftool skeleton, then user space). Each example has its own copy of the Makefile.\n- **Docs:** the English/Chinese README pairing, `SUMMARY.md`, and the TOC and guideline scripts.","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"79e9376f-f45c-4af8-8232-bf3e9ecd24f6","total_cost_usd":0.26005199999999995,"usage":{"input_tokens":24,"cache_creation_input_tokens":14370,"cache_read_input_tokens":344025,"output_tokens":6859,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":14370},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":488,"cache_read_input_tokens":38152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2013,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2013,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},